 of data with no special requirements"},{"cn":"斑马纹","en":"Striped","demo":"<div class=\"table-demo striped\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell\">库存</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"table-demo striped\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Inventory</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div>","when":"行数较多时，使用条纹帮助区分相邻行","when_en":"When there are many rows, use stripes to help differentiate between adjacent rows"},{"cn":"紧凑","en":"Compact","demo":"<div class=\"table-demo compact\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell\">库存</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">显示器</span><span class=\"t-cell\">42</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"table-demo compact\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Inventory</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Display</span><span class=\"t-cell\">42</span></div></div>","when":"一屏要塞进更多行的密集后台场景","when_en":"For dense admin tables that fit more rows on screen"},{"cn":"带排序","en":"Sortable","demo":"<div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">名称</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">价格 ↑</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">键盘</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥99</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">鼠标</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥199</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">Price ↑</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥99</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥199</span></div></div>","when":"用户需要按某列大小快速找目标时","when_en":"When people need to sort by a column to find an item quickly"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>多行同构数据</b>需要逐列比较，如用户、订单、日志","m":"tag-table"},{"t":"需要<b>排序、筛选</b>才能快速找到目标数据","m":"table-sort"},{"t":"每行都要带<b>行内操作</b>：编辑、删除、查看","m":"table-actions"},{"t":"<b>后台管理页</b>的主体视图，配合搜索和批量操作","m":"table-admin"}],"dont":[{"t":"只有<b>少量行和字段</b>：使用 {c:descriptions}","m":"table-few","bad":true},{"t":"内容是<b>图文混排的信息流</b>：使用 {c:list} 或 {c:card}","m":"table-media","bad":true},{"t":"手机窄屏直接显示过多列，导致频繁横向滚动","m":"table-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"只展示层级时用{c:tree}；还要比较多列时再考虑树形表格","m":"table-tree","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"客服要比较 50 笔订单的编号、金额、状态和下单时间。哪种展示最合适？","options":[{"id":"order-cards","label":"每笔订单做成一张卡片，把四个字段上下排列","feedback":"卡片适合浏览单条丰富内容，但字段上下分散后，很难沿同一列快速比较订单。","correct":false},{"id":"comparison-table","label":"一行一笔订单，四个字段按固定列对齐","feedback":"记录结构相同，而且任务是跨记录比较；固定列能让金额、状态和时间快速对齐。","correct":true},{"id":"detail-description","label":"一次只展示一笔订单，用字段名和内容列出详情","feedback":"描述列表适合阅读一条记录；逐笔切换会失去同时比较 50 笔订单的能力。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Support staff need to compare the ID, amount, status, and date of 50 orders. Which presentation fits best?","options":[{"id":"order-cards","label":"Use one card per order and stack the four fields vertically","feedback":"Cards help browse rich individual items, but vertically scattered fields make cross-order comparison slow.","correct":false},{"id":"comparison-table","label":"Use one order per row and align the four fields in fixed columns","feedback":"Every record shares the same fields, and fixed columns make amounts, statuses, and dates easy to compare.","correct":true},{"id":"detail-description","label":"Show one order at a time as a list of field names and values","feedback":"A description list is useful for one record, but switching records removes the side-by-side comparison the task needs.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把订单列表整理成表格，一行一笔订单，固定展示编号、金额、状态和时间，保留现有筛选。手机端优先保留关键列，其余信息可横向查看或进入详情。请验证排序后各列仍对应同一订单。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Turn the order list into a table with one order per row and fixed ID, amount, status, and date columns while keeping current filters. Preserve essential columns on mobile and expose the rest by horizontal access or details. Verify rows remain aligned after sorting."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"table-demo\">\n    <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">项目</span><span class=\"t-cell\">状态</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">更新时间 ↓</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">官网改版</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">刚刚</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">年报设计</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">昨天</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">支付重构</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">已逾期</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">3 天前</span></div>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":"<table>：表格元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/table","title_en":"<table>: The Table element"},{"title":"Table 表格模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/table/","title_en":"Table Pattern"}],"scenes":["后台用户管理","订单列表","数据报表","操作日志"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"table-demo\">\n    <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Project</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Status</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">Last updated ↓</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Website refresh</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">In progress</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Just now</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Annual report design</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag green\">Completed</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Yesterday</span></div>\n    <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Payment flow rebuild</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">Overdue</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\">3 days ago</span></div>\n  </div>","use":[{"t":"Compare records field by field","m":"tag-table"},{"t":"Sort and filter structured data","m":"table-sort"},{"t":"Select several rows for a bulk action","m":"table-actions"},{"t":"Review dense operational information","m":"table-admin"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use a table for content that has no shared columns","m":"table-few","bad":true},{"t":"Put every possible field on screen at once","m":"table-media","bad":true},{"t":"Show too many columns unchanged on a narrow phone","m":"table-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"Use a tree when the task is really comparing several fields","m":"table-tree","bad":true}],"scenes":["Order management","Member list","Inventory","Analytics report"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:170px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px\" placeholder=\"Search username\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1\"></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Export</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">＋New user</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">User</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Role</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Status</span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Alex Chen</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Administrator</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag green\">Active</span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-check\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i></span><span class=\"t-cell\">Maya Lee</span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">Member</span></span><span class=\"t-cell\"><span class=\"demo-tag red\">Disabled</span></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n        <span class=\"tab active\">All</span><span class=\"tab\">Pending payment</span><span class=\"tab\">Pending shipment</span><span class=\"tab\">Completed</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;border-top:none\">\n        <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Order number</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Product</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Amount</span><