ted member permissions</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Inventory</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div>","when":"Use this for a modest amount of data with no special requirements"},{"demo":"<div class=\"table-demo striped\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Inventory</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div></div>","when":"When there are many rows, use stripes to help differentiate between adjacent rows"},{"demo":"<div class=\"table-demo compact\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell\">Inventory</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">210</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">86</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Display</span><span class=\"t-cell\">42</span></div></div>","when":"For dense admin tables that fit more rows on screen"},{"demo":"<div class=\"table-demo\" style=\"max-width:260px\">\n      <div class=\"t-row t-head\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Name</span><span class=\"t-cell t-sort\">Price ↑</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Keyboard</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥99</span></div>\n      <div class=\"t-row\"><span class=\"t-cell\">Mouse</span><span class=\"t-cell\">¥199</span></div></div>","when":"When people need to sort by a column to find an item quickly"}]},"usageMocks":{"tag-table":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text-3)\">任务</span><span style=\"width:44px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">登录页</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">进行中</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:56px;color:var(--text)\">支付流</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">已完成</span></div></div>","table-sort":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text-3)\">名称</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text);font-weight:600\">价格 ↑</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">库存</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text)\">键盘</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">¥ 99</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">210</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.3;color:var(--text)\">鼠标</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">¥ 199</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">86</span></div></div>","table-actions":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text-3)\">项目</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text-3)\">操作</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text)\">官网改版</span><span style=\"flex:1\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">进行中</span></span><span style=\"flex:1.2\"><span class=\"mk-link\">编辑</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"mk-link\">删除</span></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.2;color:var(--text)\">年报设计</span><span style=\"flex:1\"><span class=\"mk-tag green\">已完成</span></span><span style=\"flex:1.2\"><span class=\"mk-link\">编辑</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"mk-link\">删除</span></span></div></div>","table-admin":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-input\"><em>🔍 搜索用户名</em></span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">新建用户</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">管理员</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">阿油</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">成员</span></div></div>","table-few":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">字段</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">值</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text)\">版本</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text)\">v2.4.0</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">就一行数据，表头比内容还重</span></div>","table-media":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;flex:none\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text);flex:none\">新品发布</span><span style=\"flex:1;min-width:60px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">图和段落挤进格子，全变形了</span></div>","table-mobile":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-phone\" style=\"width:96px;height:132px;padding:8px 7px;gap:5px;overflow:hidden\"><span class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">项目</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">状态</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">负责人</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">时间</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap\">操作</span></span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:150%;flex:none\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:150%;flex:none\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">列太多，手机上得一直左右滑</span></div>","table-tree":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text-3)\">名称</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-3)\">大小</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text)\">src/</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">—</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"flex:1.4;color:var(--text);padding-left:14px\">components/</span><span style=\"flex:1;color:var(--text-2)\">—</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">层级关系只靠缩进表示，父子归属不清楚</span></div>"}}}